<header class="mast">
  <div class="wrap mast-inner">
    <button class="theme-toggle" id="tt" aria-label="Toggle colour theme">◐ theme</button>
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Stage 1 · Architecture &amp; Security Design <span class="dot"></span> Cryptography Course Project</div>
    <h1>Encrypted Cloud Vault with Searchable Symmetric Encryption</h1>
    <p class="lede">A complete, defensible design for storing files on an untrusted cloud while still searching them by keyword — where the server never sees a single byte of plaintext, a filename, or a keyword.</p>
    <div class="meta-strip">
      <span class="chip">Scheme <b>Π<sub>bas</sub> single-keyword SSE</b></span>
      <span class="chip">Stack <b>Python + Flask</b></span>
      <span class="chip">Adversary <b>honest-but-curious cloud</b></span>
      <span class="chip">Status <b>implemented — Phases 1–6 complete, 230/230 tests</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap grid">
  <nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents">
    <p class="toc-title">Contents</p>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#scope">Requirements &amp; scope</a></li>
      <li><a href="#roles">Client vs. simulated cloud</a></li>
      <li><a href="#architecture">System architecture</a></li>
      <li><a href="#keys">Key management</a></li>
