    <section id="keys">
      <div class="sec-num">Section 04</div>
      <h2>Key management</h2>
      <p>All keys descend from one thing the user knows: a password. We never store a key — we store only a random <code>salt</code> and the KDF parameters, and re-derive every key at unlock time. Keys live in the trusted client's memory for the session and are wiped on lock.</p>

